  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AR CRL1 APL1 Buenos Aires Infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objectives (PDOs) of this project are to: (i) enhance the provision of water andsewerage services for the benefitof low-income people, in particular for those peopleliving in highly vulnerable areas; (ii) improve high priority road segments of theBorrower&#x2019;s road network; (iii) mitigate urban flooding; and (iv) support thereactivation of the Borrower&#x2019;s economy and strengthen its regional competitiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
